# The shipped platforms, one "<goos> <goarch>" per line. `ghrelease build` builds only a
# target named here and `ghrelease sums` requires every tool for every target named here,
# so this file is the one list of what a release ships; it is embedded in the tool. The
# build matrices in .github/workflows/release.yml and certification.yml cannot read a
# file, so each carries the same list as a literal matrix; internal/ci's
# TestReleaseMatricesAreTheTargetsFile holds all three equal.
linux amd64
linux arm64
darwin arm64
darwin amd64
windows amd64
